mapping "O984A.1" source="O984A" target="111879004" relationship=partial_overlap {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source O984A SNOMED CT 111879004 = hepatitis A in the mother complicating pregnancy, childbirth and
        puerperium. The source bundles (a) hepatitis A infection and (b) the pregnancy-complication
        framing. Best SNOMED CT target for the hepatitis A component is 196625 (Viral hepatitis A without
        hepatic coma); no specific SNOMED CT concept exists for. partial because target covers only the
        hepatitis A component, not the obstetric-complication aspect. Low tier due to partial overlap
        and absence of a combined standard concept.
        """
}
