mapping "P211A.1" source="P211A" target="57284007" relationship=equivalent {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source P211A SNOMED CT 57284007 = mild, short-lived neonatal asphyxia, Apgar < 4 at 1 minute. Note:
        the Swedish name pairs (mild) with Apgar < 4 at 1 min, which is the severe-band threshold; this
        is internally inconsistent but the Apgar < 4 at 1 min criterion corresponds to SNOMED CT 432427
        (Severe birth asphyxia). Mapped as exact_match at the available SNOMED CT granularity. Moderate
        tier due to the internal inconsistency in the source name.
        """
}
